    {
      "name": "toon",
      "status": "experimental",
      "design_doc": "docs/design/cli/toon.html",
      "summary": "Generate top/bottom PCB illustration SVGs. Raster conversion is left to consumers; no PNG or output-format options are provided. Report progressive loading, variant, side, named-model completion, component-rendering and output status, ending with success and the output directory. Root --verbose adds timing, worker and cache diagnostics; --quiet retains warnings/errors. Unsupported-model warnings identify filenames and formats/extensions. Use the shared TypeSpec-authored PCB SVG config, generated structural codecs and editable presets. Load project metadata and discover sibling projects without parsing schematics, preserving PCB project parameters and variants. Reuse artwork across project variants and successful cached placements before mesh loading; expose --workers (default 4) for STEP tessellation and component HLR/illustration, --timings JSON and --cache-dir/--no-cache for persistent model/artwork reuse. Unsupported or failed models warn and are omitted.",
      "surface_ref": "docs/design/cli/toon.html"
    },
